# Frontend design

- Cockpit is desktop-first and dense: deep black, graphite, warm ivory, off-white, beige.
- No gratuitous glassmorphism, decorative gradients, giant empty cards, or generic AI-SaaS styling.
- Static metadata uses zero-pill discipline. Operational numbers use tabular numerals.
- Use semantic tokens (brand, surface, text, border, status, map, chart) rather than raw colors in components.
- Every data surface defines loading, empty, partial, error, offline, stale, denied, processing, success, warning, and critical. Do not leave a skeleton in place of an error.
- Field Companion is a separate surface, not a compressed desktop.
